    {
        "text": "Erasing memories. This is something Theresa actually lacks experience in."
    },
    {
        "text": "Not to mention she now faces a rare kind of mind."
    },
    {
        "text": "She knows not what she will see, and has no clue if it will be dangerous. But there is no room to retreat."
    },
    {
        "text": "She has made the final decision of her life."
    },
    {
        "text": "She walks into the Doctor's memories, and cuts them up into countless fragments of dissipating threads."
    },
    {
        "text": "Memory fades away in silence."
    },
    {
        "text": "She walks through a world she has never seen and could never understand."
    },
    {
        "text": "How did such a glorious civilization meet its end?"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do geniuses as bright as shooting stars struggle for a solution to their ultimate problem, yet find nothing?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is resistance futile? Is unity a mere fantasy?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is Terra's future already set in stone? What of her beloved homeland?"
    },
    {
        "text": "What of her loved ones?"
    },
    {
        "text": "She has no answer. She cannot find the answer."
    },
    {
        "text": "She can only continue meandering in the void of memories gone."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_openftstpwalk",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Finally, she sees someone familiar."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
