        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Is all their enthusiasm overwhelming you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_048"
    },
    {
        "text": "What brings you here, Kal'tsit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Should I not be present at this celebration of your latest victory?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_048"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been a long time since I last... days like these were rare back then, you know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or I should say, I've grown so unaccustomed to it now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter, you will get used to it again, in time. Babel will be a new beginning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#13$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go. We should enjoy this celebration.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa watches Kal'tsit pat the Doctor before gently pushing that very back into the waiting crowd."
    },
    {
        "text": "Too many are forcing their way through the throng, hands stretched out, fighting each other to be the first to shake the Doctor's hand, or pat the Doctor's shoulder."
    },
    {
        "text": "Some taller and gutsier ones even try to put their hands right on the Doctor's head for a good kneading."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_048"
    },
    {
        "text": "...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1311_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh, sorry about that unruly subordinate of mine, Doctor. I wanted to stop him...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "text": "But my arm's injured... so I couldn't make it in time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_048"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine... how's your arm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1311_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Recovery's going pretty well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a pity you won't get to enjoy many drinks here tonight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1309_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "100,0",
        "posto": "100,0",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's alright, Doctor. I'll have a few more pints on this guy's behalf.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "We might have gotten ourselves stuck in that encirclement, had you not sprung that surprise attack at the end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "C'mon, let's slam a few glasses to honor the Doctor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm afraid my alcohol tolerance may disappoint you, Ace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "r",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_050",
        "posfrom": "-50,0",
        "posto": "-50,0",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Excuuuuse\u2014me,\u2014make\u2014way please... I have to see the protagonist of the day!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "So many people in here! This is the first time I feel that the command center is too small... do you want me to widen it later? There's still so many people outside hurrying in here with snacks and drinks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1072_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, everyone's cheering for the victory you've brought us, but you seem a little... uneasy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought I was masking it pretty well. *ahem* I'm just a little nervous in crowds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown3",
