    {
        "text": "The joy fades away, as do the memories and voices."
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa erases the memory she is too familiar with, and continues forward."
    },
    {
        "text": "She sees a record she has never seen before within PRTS."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
