        "volume": 0,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "c"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "channel": "c",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.2,
        "r": 0.92,
        "g": 0.4,
        "b": 0.3,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1360_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need you to contact the closest rescue team! The wrecked transport has a Rim Billiton logo on it, this is your squad...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "I hear someone still alive in there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "*bzzt* We got your call, but it'll take some time for us to rush over from the nearest mining plate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Comms"
    },
    {
        "text": "Based on the information you gave us, there's been banditry at your location there before, so we'll also notify armed security to send a dispatch at once.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Comms"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1360_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Armed security...? But with the way Rim Billiton treats Infected orphans...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "channel": "c",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_removestone",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "49_i20_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "xScale": 1.1,
        "yScale": 1.1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleFrom": 1.1,
        "yScaleFrom": 1.1,
        "xScaleTo": 1,
        "yScaleTo": 1,
        "duration": 20,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Just hold on... I'll get you out of there myself...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, stay with me... gah... that's a good girl, give me your hand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold tight!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... I'm so... tired...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's your name\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Name...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "49_i20_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleFrom": 1,
        "yScaleFrom": 1,
        "xScaleTo": 1.1,
        "yScaleTo": 1.1,
        "duration": 20,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Mum... calls me... Amiya...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, just hold on tight!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I'm holding\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't let go\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "c",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "text": "The memory shatters."
    },
    {
        "text": "This is Theresa's destination, the terminus of the Doctor's memory\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Theresa...'"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is impossible. Every memory should have been...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Theresa.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "She follows the voice to a void, and it speaks once more from behind the nothingness."
    },
    {
        "text": "Where am I\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$calm_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
