    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're finally here. I've been waiting for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1360_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not many people call me that. They prefer my team codename\u2014'Oracle'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Oracle...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you're the one Kal'tsit believes in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1360_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've let her down terribly. But we had no choice, I'm entangled in an inescapable plot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oracle"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been watching you from here as you went around nurturing your hopes, as you suffered betrayal\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oracle"
    },
    {
        "text": "As if I was looking at my past self.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oracle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are only residue of the Doctor's burned away emotions. There's no way for me to preserve your emotions and memories in our current circumstances...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1360_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've reached your destination, so just do what you have to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oracle"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for trusting me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oracle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It may be a little late for this... but I'm glad to meet you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1360_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm glad to meet you too, Theresa.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oracle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
