        "volume": 1,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "s"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oracle walks into the distance of the endless wheat fields, disappearing within the stalks."
    },
    {
        "text": "A draft of wind tears through the plain with a roar, and the final scene disperses until only the end of a thread is left."
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "s",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa holds the strand. It quickly loses its luster, and turns into powdery dust."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's time to say goodbye...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll meet again in the future, won't we...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kal'tsit... Amiya...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
